    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a12">

                <pb facs="0658" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg588"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 16.—Telegram.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Luis Potosi,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 5, 1867—7 <hi rendition="#italic">in the
                            evening.</hi></date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mariano Riva Palacio,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Queretaro:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The President of the republic has taken into consideration the message you
                    addressed me to-day, received at half past 3 this afternoon, and I already
                    communicate by telegraph to the secretary of war such extension of the term for
                    defence as the government deems possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
